NOTE ON SCOPE

This license covers only the original work in this repository: the tools in
tools/, the RomRaider definitions in definitions/, and the written analysis in
docs/, FINDINGS.md and README.md.

It does NOT cover:

  - rom/*.bin and rom-denso/*.bin — Subaru/Fuji Heavy Industries firmware,
    included for interoperability and repair research. All rights remain with
    its owner.

  - decompiled/*.c and decompiled-denso/*.c — machine-generated output derived
    from those binaries, carrying the same status.

  - docs/forum_thread_13725.txt and docs/forum_thread_20850.txt — archives of
    two RomRaider forum topics. These are other people's posts, kept because
    forum threads are not permanent and because working from a partial copy has
    cost this project time. Reproduced for reference and credited in README.md.

  - logs/*.csv — vehicle logs recorded and shared by cortin. Not my work.

  - docs/shift-curves-reference.png — a chart produced and posted by a member
    of the RomRaider forum community (thread "5EAT TCM JECS ROM Image", page 9).
    Reproduced for reference because the shift-schedule units were verified
    against it. Not my work and not mine to license. The author's username is
    not visible to logged-out visitors; if it is yours, open an issue and it
    will be credited or the file removed on request.

  - romraider-5eat/ — patches against RomRaider, which is GPL-2.0. See
    romraider-5eat/LICENSE. A package built from them is a derivative of a
    GPL-2.0 program and carries that licence, not this one.

The ROM images were dumped and shared by members of the RomRaider forum thread
"5EAT TCM JECS ROM Image". They are included for interoperability and repair
research. No ownership is claimed over any of them.
